"""Element definitions and statement structures for the draft Canadian PSAS taxonomy (pilot)
and the Province of Ontario 2025-26 extension.

Conventions
- Monetary items carry no balance attribute in this pilot; signs follow the "effect" convention below.
- Natural-value elements (revenues, expenses, assets, liabilities, acquisitions, repayments) are positive;
  rows shown in parentheses for such elements have mode 'neg' (fact value = -(displayed signed number)).
- Effect elements (adjustments, changes, surpluses/deficits, net financial assets) carry the sign shown
  in the statement; mode 'disp'.
"""

PSAS_NS = "http://xbrl.example.org/ca-psas/2026"
PSAS_PREFIX = "psas"
ON_NS = "http://xbrl.example.org/ca-on/2026"
ON_PREFIX = "on"

